#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:14
msgid ""
"To activate the *Leads* setting, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` and check the box labeled, :guilabel:`Leads`. "
"Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"*Lidlar* sozlamasini faollashtirish uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Leads` deb "
"nomlangan katakchani belgilang. So'ngra :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:None
msgid "Leads setting on CRM configuration page."
msgstr "CRM konfiguratsiya sahifasidagi Lidlar sozlamasi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:20
msgid ""
"Activating this feature adds the :guilabel:`Leads` menu option to the header "
"bar located along the top of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu funksiyani faollashtirish ekranning yuqori qismida joylashgan sarlavha "
"paneliga :guilabel:`Leads` menyu bandini qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:None
msgid "Leads menu on CRM application."
msgstr "CRM ilovasidagi Lidlar menyusi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:26
msgid ""
"Once the *Leads* setting has been activated, it applies to all sales teams "
"by default. To turn off leads for a specific team, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Sales Teams`. Then, select "
"a team from the list to open that team's configuration page. Clear "
"the :guilabel:`Leads` checkbox, located beneath the :guilabel:`Sales Team` "
"field, then click :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"*Lidlar* sozlamasi faollashtirilgach, u standart holatda barcha sotuv "
"jamoalariga qo'llaniladi. Muayyan jamoa uchun lidlarni o'chirish "
"uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Sales Teams` yo'lidan "
"o'ting. So'ngra ro'yxatdan jamoani tanlab, o'sha jamoaning konfiguratsiya "
"sahifasini oching. :guilabel:`Sales Team` maydoni ostida "
"joylashgan :guilabel:`Leads` belgilash katagidagi belgini olib tashlang, "
"so'ngra :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:36
msgid "Convert a lead into an opportunity"
msgstr "Lidni imkoniyatga aylantirish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:38
msgid ""
"To convert a lead into an *opportunity*, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app "
"--> Leads`, and click on a lead from the list to open it."
msgstr ""
"Lidni *imkoniyatga* aylantirish uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va uni ochish uchun ro'yxatdagi lid ustiga bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:42
msgid ""
"Attempting to convert a lead with a 100% probability into an opportunity "
"will result in an error message."
msgstr ""
"100% ehtimollikka ega lidni imkoniyatga aylantirishga urinish xatolik xabari "
"bilan yakunlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:0
msgid ""
"The error message that appears when attempting to convert a 100% probability "
"lead into\n"
"an opportunity."
msgstr ""
"100% ehtimollikka ega lidni imkoniyatga aylantirishga urinilganda paydo "
"bo'ladigan xatolik xabari."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:49
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Convert to Opportunity` button, located at the top-left "
"of the page."
msgstr ""
"Sahifaning yuqori chap qismida joylashgan :guilabel:`Convert to Opportunity` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:None
msgid "Create opportunity button on a lead record."
msgstr "Lid yozuvidagi imkoniyat yaratish tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:54
msgid ""
"This opens a *Convert to opportunity* pop-up. Here, select "
"the :guilabel:`Convert to opportunity` option in the :guilabel:`Conversion "
"Action` field."
msgstr ""
"Bu *Imkoniyatga aylantirish* qalqib chiquvchi oynasini ochadi. Bu "
"yerda :guilabel:`Conversion Action` maydonida :guilabel:`Convert to "
"opportunity` variantini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:57
msgid ""
"Then, select a :guilabel:`Salesperson` and a :guilabel:`Sales Team` to which "
"the opportunity should be assigned. Neither field is required, but if a "
"selection is made in the :guilabel:`Salesperson` field, the :guilabel:`Sales "
"Team` is automatically populated based on the assignee's assigned team."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra imkoniyat biriktirilishi kerak bo'lgan :guilabel:`Salesperson` "
"va :guilabel:`Sales Team` ni tanlang. Ikkala maydon ham majburiy emas, "
"biroq :guilabel:`Salesperson` maydonida tanlov qilinsa, :guilabel:`Sales "
"Team` maydoni mas'ul shaxsning biriktirilgan jamoasi asosida avtomatik "
"to'ldiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:61
msgid ""
"If the lead has already been assigned to a salesperson or a team, these "
"fields automatically populate with that information."
msgstr ""
"Agar lid allaqachon sotuvchiga yoki jamoaga biriktirilgan bo'lsa, ushbu "
"maydonlar shu ma'lumot bilan avtomatik to'ldiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:64
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Customer` heading, choose from the following options:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Customer` sarlavhasi ostida quyidagi variantlardan birini tanlang:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create a new customer`: Choose this option to use the information "
"in the lead to create a new customer record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Create a new customer`: liddagi ma'lumotlardan foydalanib yangi "
"mijoz yozuvini yaratish uchun ushbu variantni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Link to an existing customer`: Choose this option, then select a "
"customer from the drop-down menu to link this opportunity to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Link to an existing customer`: ushbu variantni tanlang, so'ngra "
"ushbu imkoniyatni bog'lash uchun ochiluvchi menyudan mijozni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:71
msgid ""
"Lastly, when all configurations are complete, click :guilabel:`Create "
"Opportunity`."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, barcha sozlashlar yakunlangach, :guilabel:`Create Opportunity` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:None
msgid "Create opportunity pop-up."
msgstr "Imkoniyat yaratish qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:76
msgid ""
"To view the newly created opportunity, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --"
"> My Pipeline`."
msgstr ""
"Yangi yaratilgan imkoniyatni ko'rish uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> My "
"Pipeline` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:79
#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:35
msgid "Merging similar leads and opportunities"
msgstr "O'xshash lidlar va imkoniyatlarni birlashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:81
msgid ""
"If a :guilabel:`Similar Leads` smart button appears at the top of the page "
"for the lead, a similar lead or opportunity already exists in the database. "
"Before converting the current lead, click the smart button to check if the "
"leads should be merged."
msgstr ""
"Agar lid sahifasining yuqori qismida :guilabel:`Similar Leads` smart tugmasi "
"paydo bo'lsa, ma'lumotlar bazasida o'xshash lid yoki imkoniyat allaqachon "
"mavjud. Joriy lidni aylantirishdan oldin, lidlarni birlashtirish kerak yoki "
"kerak emasligini tekshirish uchun smart tugmani bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:0
msgid "Close up of a lead with emphasis on the Similar Leads smart button."
msgstr ""
"Similar Leads smart tugmasiga urg'u berilgan lidning yaqindan ko'rinishi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:88
msgid ""
"To merge this lead with an existing similar lead or opportunity, click "
"the :guilabel:`Convert to Opportunity` button and select :guilabel:`Merge "
"with existing opportunities` in the :guilabel:`Conversion Action` field. "
"This generates a list of the similar leads/opportunities to be merged."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu lidni mavjud o'xshash lid yoki imkoniyat bilan birlashtirish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Convert to Opportunity` tugmasini bosing "
"va :guilabel:`Conversion Action` maydonida :guilabel:`Merge with existing "
"opportunities` variantini tanlang. Bu birlashtiriladigan o'xshash lidlar/"
"imkoniyatlar ro'yxatini hosil qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:93
msgid ""
"When merging, Odoo gives priority to whichever lead/opportunity was created "
"in the system first, merging the information into the first created lead/"
"opportunity. The resulting record is an opportunity."
msgstr ""
"Birlashtirishda Odoo tizimda birinchi bo'lib yaratilgan lid/imkoniyatga "
"ustuvorlik beradi va ma'lumotlarni birinchi yaratilgan lid/imkoniyatga "
"birlashtiradi. Natijada hosil bo'lgan yozuv imkoniyat bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:3
msgid "Create leads (from email or manually)"
msgstr "Lidlar yaratish (email orqali yoki qo'lda)"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:8
msgid ""
"Leads can be added to the *CRM* app from custom email aliases, and by "
"manually creating new records. This is in addition to the leads and "
"opportunities created in the app through the :doc:`website contact form "
"<opportunities_form>`."
msgstr ""
"Lidlar *CRM* ilovasiga maxsus email taxalluslari orqali va yangi yozuvlarni "
"qo'lda yaratish orqali qo'shilishi mumkin. Bu ilovada :doc:`veb-sayt aloqa "
"formasi <opportunities_form>` orqali yaratilgan lidlar va imkoniyatlarga "
"qo'shimcha hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:12
msgid ""
"First, ensure the *Leads* feature is enabled in the database by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Tick "
"the :guilabel:`Leads` checkbox, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Avvalo, :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan "
"o'tib, ma'lumotlar bazasida *Lidlar* funksiyasi yoqilganligiga ishonch hosil "
"qiling. :guilabel:`Leads` belgilash katagini belgilang, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:19
msgid "Configure email aliases"
msgstr "Email taxalluslarini sozlash"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:21
msgid ""
"Each sales team has the option to create and utilize their own unique email "
"alias. When messages are sent to this address, a lead (or opportunity), is "
"created with the information from the message."
msgstr ""
"Har bir sotuv jamoasi o'zining noyob email taxallusini yaratish va undan "
"foydalanish imkoniyatiga ega. Ushbu manzilga xabarlar yuborilganda, "
"xabardagi ma'lumotlar asosida lid (yoki imkoniyat) yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:25
msgid ""
"To create or update a sales teams' email alias, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Sales Teams`. Click on a "
"team from the list to open the team's details page."
msgstr ""
"Sotuv jamoasining email taxallusini yaratish yoki yangilash "
"uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Sales Teams` yo'lidan "
"o'ting. Jamoaning tafsilotlar sahifasini ochish uchun ro'yxatdagi jamoa "
"ustiga bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:None
msgid "The sales team details page, focused on the email alias section."
msgstr ""
"Sotuv jamoasi tafsilotlari sahifasi, email taxallusi bo'limiga qaratilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:32
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Email Alias` field, enter a name for the email alias, or "
"edit the existing name. In the :guilabel:`Accept Emails From` field, use the "
"drop-down menu to choose who is allowed to send messages to this email alias:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Email Alias` maydoniga email taxallusi uchun nom kiriting yoki "
"mavjud nomni tahrirlang. :guilabel:`Accept Emails From` maydonida ushbu "
"email taxallusiga kim xabar yuborishi mumkinligini tanlash uchun ochiluvchi "
"menyudan foydalaning:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:36
msgid ":guilabel:`Everyone`: messages are accepted from any email address."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Everyone`: xabarlar istalgan email manzilidan qabul qilinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Authenticated Partners`: only accepts messages from email "
"addresses associated with a a partner (contact or customer) record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Authenticated Partners`: faqat hamkor (kontakt yoki mijoz) "
"yozuviga bog'langan email manzillaridan kelgan xabarlarni qabul qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Followers only`: only accepts messages from those who are "
"following a record related to the team, such as a lead or opportunity. "
"Messages are also accepted from team members."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Followers only`: faqat jamoaga tegishli yozuvni, masalan, lid "
"yoki imkoniyatni kuzatib borayotganlardan kelgan xabarlarni qabul qiladi. "
"Jamoa a'zolaridan kelgan xabarlar ham qabul qilinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Authenticated Employees`: only accepts messages from email "
"addresses that are connected to a record in the *Employees* app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Authenticated Employees`: faqat *Employees* ilovasidagi yozuvga "
"bog'langan email manzillaridan kelgan xabarlarni qabul qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:45
msgid "Leads created from email"
msgstr "Email orqali yaratilgan lidlar"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:47
msgid ""
"Leads created from email alias messages can be viewed by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads`. Click a lead from the list to open "
"it, and view the details."
msgstr ""
"Email taxallusi xabarlaridan yaratilgan lidlarni :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Leads` yo'lidan o'tib ko'rish mumkin. Uni ochish va tafsilotlarni ko'rish "
"uchun ro'yxatdagi lid ustiga bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:50
msgid ""
"The email received by the alias is added to the *chatter* thread for the "
"lead. The subject line of the message is added to the title field, and "
"the :guilabel:`Email` field is updated with the contact's email address."
msgstr ""
"Taxallus tomonidan qabul qilingan email lidning *chatter* mavzusiga "
"qo'shiladi. Xabarning mavzu qatori sarlavha maydoniga qo'shiladi "
"va :guilabel:`Email` maydoni kontaktning email manzili bilan yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:None
msgid "The chatter thread of a newly created lead in the CRM app."
msgstr "CRM ilovasida yangi yaratilgan lidning chatter mavzusi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:59
msgid ""
"If the *leads* feature is **not** enabled on the database, messages to the "
"email alias are added to the database as opportunities."
msgstr ""
"Agar *lidlar* funksiyasi ma'lumotlar bazasida yoqilgan **bo'lmasa**, email "
"taxallusiga kelgan xabarlar ma'lumotlar bazasiga imkoniyatlar sifatida "
"qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:63
msgid ":doc:`../../../general/email_communication`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../general/email_communication`"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:66
msgid "Manually create leads"
msgstr "Lidlarni qo'lda yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:68
msgid ""
"Leads can be added directly to the *CRM* app by manually creating a new "
"record. Navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads` to view a list of "
"existing leads."
msgstr ""
"Lidlar yangi yozuvni qo'lda yaratish orqali to'g'ridan-to'g'ri *CRM* "
"ilovasiga qo'shilishi mumkin. Mavjud lidlar ro'yxatini ko'rish "
"uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:72
msgid ""
"Leads can also be added via the :doc:`Generate Leads <lead_mining>` button."
msgstr ""
"Lidlar :doc:`Generate Leads <lead_mining>` tugmasi orqali ham qo'shilishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:74
msgid ""
"At the top-left of the list, click :guilabel:`New` to open a "
"blank :guilabel:`Leads` form."
msgstr ""
"Bo'sh :guilabel:`Leads` formasini ochish uchun ro'yxatning yuqori chap "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:76
msgid ""
"In the first field of the new form, enter a title for the new lead. Next, "
"enter a :guilabel:`Contact Name`, and a :guilabel:`Company Name`."
msgstr ""
"Yangi formaning birinchi maydoniga yangi lid uchun sarlavha kiriting. "
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Contact Name` va :guilabel:`Company Name` maydonlarini "
"kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:80
msgid ""
"If a lead is :doc:`converted to an opportunity <convert>`, "
"the :guilabel:`Company Name` field is used to either link this opportunity "
"to an existing customer, or to create a new customer."
msgstr ""
"Agar lid :doc:`imkoniyatga aylantirilsa <convert>`, :guilabel:`Company Name` "
"maydoni ushbu imkoniyatni mavjud mijozga bog'lash yoki yangi mijoz yaratish "
"uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:84
msgid "Manually create opportunities"
msgstr "Imkoniyatlarni qo'lda yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:86
msgid ""
"To manually create an opportunity, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Sales --> My Pipeline`. At the top-left of the page, click :guilabel:`New` "
"to create a new opportunity Kanban card. In the :guilabel:`Organization/"
"Contact` field, enter the name of the company the opportunity is for."
msgstr ""
"Imkoniyatni qo'lda yaratish uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> Sales --> My "
"Pipeline` yo'lidan o'ting. Sahifaning yuqori chap qismida yangi imkoniyat "
"Kanban kartochkasini yaratish uchun :guilabel:`New` tugmasini "
"bosing. :guilabel:`Organization/Contact` maydoniga imkoniyat mo'ljallangan "
"kompaniya nomini kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:90
msgid ""
"Choose a name, and enter it in the :guilabel:`Opportunity` field. *This is a "
"required field.* When manually creating an opportunity, it is helpful to add "
"a name that relates to the details of the opportunity."
msgstr ""
"Nom tanlang va uni :guilabel:`Opportunity` maydoniga kiriting. *Bu majburiy "
"maydon.* Imkoniyatni qo'lda yaratishda imkoniyat tafsilotlariga bog'liq nom "
"qo'shish foydali bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:95
msgid ""
"In the example below, the opportunity is named `5 VP Chairs`. This "
"identifies the product the customer is interested in, as well as the "
"potential number of products."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi misolda imkoniyat `5 VP Chairs` deb nomlangan. Bu mijoz "
"qiziqayotgan mahsulotni, shuningdek, mahsulotlarning taxminiy sonini "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:0
msgid "An example of an opportunity in the CRM pipeline."
msgstr "CRM pipeline'idagi imkoniyat misoli."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:102
msgid ""
"Enter the contact information for the opportunity in the :guilabel:`Email` "
"and :guilabel:`Phone` fields."
msgstr ""
"Imkoniyat uchun kontakt ma'lumotlarini :guilabel:`Email` "
"va :guilabel:`Phone` maydonlariga kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:105
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Expected Revenue` field, enter an estimated value for the "
"opportunity."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Expected Revenue` maydoniga imkoniyat uchun taxminiy qiymatni "
"kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:108
msgid ""
"The information in the :guilabel:`Expected Revenue` and priority fields can "
"be used to track performance for individual salespeople, and on a team "
"basis. See :doc:`../performance/expected_revenue_report` and :doc:`../"
"track_leads/lead_scoring` for more information."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Expected Revenue` va ustuvorlik maydonlaridagi ma'lumotlardan "
"alohida sotuvchilarning va jamoa darajasidagi samaradorlikni kuzatish uchun "
"foydalanish mumkin. Batafsil ma'lumot uchun :doc:`../performance/"
"expected_revenue_report` va :doc:`../track_leads/lead_scoring` sahifalariga "
"qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:113
msgid "Then, use the |st-o| :guilabel:`(star)` icons to assign a priority."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra ustuvorlikni belgilash uchun |st-o| :guilabel:`(star)` belgilaridan "
"foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:115
msgid "|st-o| |st-o| |st-o|: low priority"
msgstr "|st-o| |st-o| |st-o|: past ustuvorlik"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:116
msgid "|st| |st-o| |st-o|: medium priority"
msgstr "|st| |st-o| |st-o|: o'rta ustuvorlik"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:117
msgid "|st| |st| |st-o|: high priority"
msgstr "|st| |st| |st-o|: yuqori ustuvorlik"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:118
msgid "|st| |st| |st|: very high priority"
msgstr "|st| |st| |st|: juda yuqori ustuvorlik"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:121
msgid ""
"Assigning a priority changes the order of leads in Kanban view, with higher "
"priority leads displayed first."
msgstr ""
"Ustuvorlik belgilash kanban ko'rinishidagi lidlar tartibini o'zgartiradi, "
"bunda yuqori ustuvorlikdagi lidlar birinchi bo'lib ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:124
msgid ""
"Once all the necessary information has been entered, click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""
"Barcha zarur ma'lumotlar kiritilgandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Add` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:None
msgid "The CRM pipeline with a newly created opportunity."
msgstr "Yangi yaratilgan imkoniyat bilan CRM pipeline'i."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:3
msgid "Lead mining"
msgstr "Lidlarni qidirish (lead mining)"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:8
msgid ""
"*Lead mining* is a feature that allows *CRM* users to generate new leads "
"directly within their Odoo database. To ensure lead qualification, lead "
"mining output is determined by a variety of filtering criteria, such as the "
"country, the company size, and the industry."
msgstr ""
"*Lead mining* — bu *CRM* foydalanuvchilariga yangi lidlarni to'g'ridan-"
"to'g'ri o'z Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasida yaratish imkonini beruvchi funksiya. "
"Lidlarning sifatini ta'minlash uchun lead mining natijalari mamlakat, "
"kompaniya hajmi va soha kabi turli filtrlash mezonlari asosida aniqlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:15
msgid ""
"To get started, go to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, and select the :guilabel:`Lead Mining` checkbox to activate the "
"feature. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Boshlash uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va funksiyani faollashtirish uchun :guilabel:`Lead Mining` "
"belgilash katagini tanlang. So'ngra :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:None
msgid "Activate lead mining in Odoo CRM settings."
msgstr "Odoo CRM sozlamalarida lead mining funksiyasini faollashtirish."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:22
msgid "Generate leads"
msgstr "Lidlarni yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:25
msgid ""
"If the :doc:`Leads </applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert>` feature "
"is not enabled, then lead generation creates opportunities instead."
msgstr ""
"Agar :doc:`Lidlar </applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert>` "
"funksiyasi yoqilmagan bo'lsa, lidlarni yaratish o'rniga imkoniyatlar "
"yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:28
msgid ""
"With the *Lead Mining* setting activated, the *Generate Leads* button is "
"added to the upper-left corner of the *CRM* *Pipeline* (:menuselection:`CRM "
"app --> Sales --> My Pipeline`). Lead mining requests are also available "
"through :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Lead Mining Requests` "
"and through :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads`, where "
"the :guilabel:`Generate Leads` button is also available."
msgstr ""
"*Lead Mining* sozlamasi faollashtirilgandan so'ng, *Generate Leads* tugmasi "
"*CRM* *Pipeline*ning yuqori chap burchagiga qo'shiladi (:menuselection:`CRM "
"app --> Sales --> My Pipeline`). Lead mining so'rovlari "
"shuningdek :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Lead Mining "
"Requests` orqali va :guilabel:`Generate Leads` tugmasi ham mavjud "
"bo'lgan :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads` orqali ochish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:34
msgid ""
"From any of these locations, click the :guilabel:`Generate Leads` button, "
"and a pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu joylarning istalgan biridan :guilabel:`Generate Leads` tugmasini "
"bosing, shunda qalqib chiquvchi oyna paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:None
msgid ""
"The pop-up window with the selection criteria in order to generate leads in "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da lidlarni yaratish uchun tanlov mezonlari ko'rsatilgan qalqib "
"chiquvchi oyna."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:40
msgid ""
"Leads can be generated for :guilabel:`Companies` to get company information "
"only, or for |CC| to get both company information and contact information "
"for individual employees."
msgstr ""
"Lidlar faqat kompaniya ma'lumotlarini olish uchun :guilabel:`Companies` "
"bo'yicha yoki kompaniya ma'lumotlari bilan birga alohida xodimlarning "
"kontakt ma'lumotlarini ham olish uchun |CC| bo'yicha yaratilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:43
msgid "Filtering options for generating leads include the following:"
msgstr ""
"Lidlarni yaratish uchun filtrlash imkoniyatlari quyidagilarni o'z ichiga "
"oladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:45
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Countries`: Filter leads based on the country (or countries) they "
"are located in."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Countries`: Lidlarni ular joylashgan mamlakat (yoki mamlakatlar) "
"bo'yicha filtrlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`States`: Filter leads even further based on the state in which "
"they are located, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`States`: Agar tegishli bo'lsa, lidlarni ular joylashgan shtat "
"bo'yicha yanada aniqroq filtrlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Industries`: Filter leads based on the specific industry they "
"work in."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Industries`: Lidlarni ular faoliyat yuritayotgan muayyan soha "
"bo'yicha filtrlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Filter on Size`: Generates a field labeled :guilabel:`Size`. Fill "
"in the blanks to create a range for the desired company size based on its "
"number of employees."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Filter on Size`: :guilabel:`Size` deb nomlangan maydonni "
"yaratadi. Xodimlar soniga asoslangan holda kerakli kompaniya hajmi uchun "
"oraliq yaratish maqsadida bo'sh joylarni to'ldiring."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:53
msgid ""
"When using |CC|, generated contacts can also be filtered based on "
"their :guilabel:`Role` or :guilabel:`Seniority`."
msgstr ""
"|CC| ishlatilganda, yaratilgan kontaktlarni ularning :guilabel:`Role` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Seniority` maydonlari bo'yicha ham filtrlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:56
msgid ""
"Additionally, there are options for sales team assignment and internal "
"tracking:"
msgstr ""
"Bundan tashqari, sotuv jamoasini tayinlash va ichki kuzatuv uchun "
"imkoniyatlar mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Team`: Set which Sales Team the leads will be assigned to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sales Team`: Lidlar qaysi sotuv jamoasiga tayinlanishini "
"belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson`: Set which member of the Sales Team the leads will "
"be assigned to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson`: Lidlar sotuv jamoasining qaysi a'zosiga "
"tayinlanishini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Tags`: Set which tags are applied directly to the leads "
"once found."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Default Tags`: Lidlar topilgandan so'ng ularga bevosita qaysi "
"teglar qo'llanishini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:63
msgid ""
"If applicable, make sure to be aware of the latest EU regulations when "
"receiving contact information. Learn more about the General Data Protection "
"Regulation on `Odoo GDPR <http://odoo.com/gdpr>`_."
msgstr ""
"Agar tegishli bo'lsa, kontakt ma'lumotlarini qabul qilishda Yevropa "
"Ittifoqining eng so'nggi qoidalaridan xabardor bo'ling. Ma'lumotlarni himoya "
"qilish bo'yicha umumiy reglament (GDPR) haqida batafsil ma'lumotni `Odoo "
"GDPR <http://odoo.com/gdpr>`_ sahifasidan oling."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:68
msgid "View leads"
msgstr "Lidlarni ko'rish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:70
msgid ""
"After leads are generated, they are assigned to the designated salesperson "
"and team. To view additional information regarding the lead, select one from "
"the list and click to open it."
msgstr ""
"Lidlar yaratilgandan so'ng, ular belgilangan sotuvchi va jamoaga "
"tayinlanadi. Lid haqida qo'shimcha ma'lumotni ko'rish uchun ro'yxatdan "
"birini tanlang va uni ochish uchun bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:73
msgid ""
"Additional information for the lead is provided in its chatter. This can "
"include the number of employees that work for the lead, the technology it "
"uses, its timezone, and any direct contact information."
msgstr ""
"Lid haqidagi qo'shimcha ma'lumotlar uning chatter qismida keltiriladi. Bunga "
"lidda ishlaydigan xodimlar soni, u foydalanadigan texnologiya, uning vaqt "
"mintaqasi va har qanday to'g'ridan-to'g'ri kontakt ma'lumotlari kirishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:None
msgid "The chatter thread of a newly generated lead."
msgstr "Yangi yaratilgan lidning chatter tarmog'i."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:81
#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:80
#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:47
#: ../../content/applications/sales/rental.rst:68
msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "Narxlash"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:83
msgid ""
"Lead mining is an *In-App Purchase* service, and each generated lead costs "
"one :ref:`credit <in_app_purchase/credits>`. When using the |CC| option to "
"generate leads, one additional credit is used for each contact generated. "
"See here for complete pricing information: `Lead Generation by Odoo IAP "
"<https://iap.odoo.com/iap/in-app-services/167?>`_. Enterprise Odoo users "
"with a valid subscription get free credits to test |IAP| features before "
"purchasing more credits for the database. This includes demo/training "
"databases, educational databases, and one-app-free databases."
msgstr ""
"Lead mining — bu *In-App Purchase* xizmati bo'lib, har bir yaratilgan lid "
"bitta :ref:`kredit <in_app_purchase/credits>` turadi. Lidlarni yaratish "
"uchun |CC| variantidan foydalanilganda, har bir yaratilgan kontakt uchun "
"bitta qo'shimcha kredit sarflanadi. To'liq narxlash ma'lumotlari uchun "
"qarang: `Lead Generation by Odoo IAP <https://iap.odoo.com/iap/in-app-"
"services/167?>`_. Amaldagi obunaga ega Enterprise Odoo foydalanuvchilari "
"ma'lumotlar bazasi uchun ko'proq kreditlar sotib olishdan oldin |IAP| "
"funksiyalarini sinab ko'rish uchun bepul kreditlar oladi. Bunga demo/o'quv "
"ma'lumotlar bazalari, ta'lim ma'lumotlar bazalari va bitta ilovasi bepul "
"ma'lumotlar bazalari kiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:90
msgid ""
"To buy credits, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`. In the :guilabel:`Lead Generation` section, under "
"the :guilabel:`Lead Mining` feature, click :guilabel:`Manage Service & Buy "
"Credits` to go to the Lead Generation Settings page. Click :guilabel:`Buy "
"Credit` to go to the *Odoo IAP* page where you'll be able to buy packs of "
"Lead Generation credits."
msgstr ""
"Kreditlar sotib olish uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` yo'lidan o'ting. :guilabel:`Lead Generation` "
"bo'limida, :guilabel:`Lead Mining` funksiyasi ostida, Lead Generation "
"sozlamalari sahifasiga o'tish uchun :guilabel:`Manage Service & Buy Credits` "
"tugmasini bosing. Lead Generation kreditlari to'plamlarini sotib olish "
"mumkin bo'lgan *Odoo IAP* sahifasiga o'tish uchun :guilabel:`Buy Credit` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:96
msgid ""
"Credits may also be purchased by navigating directly to the `Odoo IAP "
"<https://iap.odoo.com/>`_ page and clicking the :guilabel:`Lead Generation` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Kreditlarni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri `Odoo IAP <https://iap.odoo.com/>`_ "
"sahifasiga o'tib, :guilabel:`Lead Generation` tugmasini bosish orqali ham "
"sotib olish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:None
#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:None
msgid "Buy credits in the Odoo IAP settings."
msgstr "Odoo IAP sozlamalarida kreditlar sotib olish."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:103
msgid ""
"Credits are **not** interchangeable between IAP services. *Lead Generation* "
"credits may not be spent on other IAP services, and no other IAP credits can "
"be spent on *Lead Generation*."
msgstr ""
"Kreditlar IAP xizmatlari o'rtasida almashtirib **bo'lmaydi**. *Lead "
"Generation* kreditlarini boshqa IAP xizmatlariga sarflab bo'lmaydi va boshqa "
"hech qanday IAP kreditlarini *Lead Generation* uchun sarflab bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:107
msgid ":doc:`/applications/essentials/in_app_purchase`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/essentials/in_app_purchase`"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:3
msgid "Create opportunities from web contact forms"
msgstr "Veb kontakt formalaridan imkoniyatlar yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:5
msgid ""
"Adding a contact form to a website makes it easy to convert visitors into "
"leads and opportunities. After a visitor submits their information, an "
"opportunity can be created automatically, and assigned to a designated sales "
"team and salesperson."
msgstr ""
"Veb-saytga kontakt formasini qo'shish tashrif buyuruvchilarni lidlar va "
"imkoniyatlarga aylantirishni osonlashtiradi. Tashrif buyuruvchi o'z "
"ma'lumotlarini yuborganidan so'ng, imkoniyat avtomatik tarzda yaratilishi va "
"belgilangan sotuv jamoasi hamda sotuvchiga tayinlanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:12
msgid "Customize contact forms"
msgstr "Kontakt formalarini moslashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:14
msgid ""
"By default, the *Contact Us* page on an Odoo website displays a "
"preconfigured contact form. This form can be customized, as needed, to suit "
"the needs of a specific sales team."
msgstr ""
"Standart bo'yicha, Odoo veb-saytidagi *Contact Us* sahifasida oldindan "
"sozlangan kontakt formasi ko'rsatiladi. Ushbu formani, kerak bo'lganda, "
"muayyan sotuv jamoasining ehtiyojlariga moslashtirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:17
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Website app --> Contact Us`, then "
"click :guilabel:`Edit` in the top-right of the screen to open the web "
"editor. Click on the form building block in the body of the webpage to open "
"the form configuration settings on the right sidebar. The following options "
"are available to customize the contact form from the :guilabel:`From` "
"section of the right sidebar:"
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Website app --> Contact Us` yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra veb "
"muharrirni ochish uchun ekranning yuqori o'ng qismidagi :guilabel:`Edit` "
"tugmasini bosing. O'ng yon paneldagi forma sozlamalarini ochish uchun veb-"
"sahifa tanasidagi forma qurilish blokini bosing. Kontakt formasini "
"moslashtirish uchun o'ng yon panelning :guilabel:`From` bo'limida quyidagi "
"imkoniyatlar mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:None
msgid "The form configuration settings on an Odoo website."
msgstr "Odoo veb-saytidagi forma sozlamalari."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Action`: the default action for a contact form is :guilabel:`Send "
"an Email`. Select :guilabel:`Create an Opportunity` from the drop-down list "
"to capture the information in the *CRM* app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Action`: kontakt formasi uchun standart amal — :guilabel:`Send an "
"Email`. Ma'lumotlarni *CRM* ilovasida qayd etish uchun ochiluvchi "
"ro'yxatdan :guilabel:`Create an Opportunity` bandini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Team`: choose a sales team from the drop-down menu that the "
"opportunities from this form should be assigned to. This field **only** "
"appears if the :guilabel:`Action` field is set to :guilabel:`Create an "
"Opportunity`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sales Team`: ushbu formadan keladigan imkoniyatlar tayinlanishi "
"kerak bo'lgan sotuv jamoasini ochiluvchi menyudan tanlang. Ushbu maydon "
"**faqat** :guilabel:`Action` maydoni :guilabel:`Create an Opportunity` qilib "
"belgilangan bo'lsa ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson`: if the opportunities should be assigned to a "
"specific salesperson, select them from the drop-down menu. If no selection "
"is made in this field, the opportunities are assigned based on the team's "
"existing rules."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson`: agar imkoniyatlar muayyan sotuvchiga tayinlanishi "
"kerak bo'lsa, uni ochiluvchi menyudan tanlang. Agar ushbu maydonda tanlov "
"amalga oshirilmasa, imkoniyatlar jamoaning mavjud qoidalari asosida "
"tayinlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Marked Fields`: use this field to alter how the form handles "
"marked fields. The default option is to treat marked fields "
"as :guilabel:`Required`, which is the recommended setting."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Marked Fields`: forma belgilangan maydonlarni qanday qayta "
"ishlashini o'zgartirish uchun ushbu maydondan foydalaning. Standart variant "
"— belgilangan maydonlarni :guilabel:`Required` sifatida ko'rib chiqish "
"bo'lib, bu tavsiya etiladigan sozlamadir."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mark Text`: choose how :guilabel:`Marked Fields` should be "
"identified. The default character is an asterisk (`*`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mark Text`: :guilabel:`Marked Fields` qanday belgilanishini "
"tanlang. Standart belgi — yulduzcha (`*`)."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Labels Width`: use this field to alter the pixel width of the "
"labels, if desired."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Labels Width`: agar xohlasangiz, yorliqlarning piksel kengligini "
"o'zgartirish uchun ushbu maydondan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On Success`: select how the webpage reacts after a customer "
"successfully submits a form. :guilabel:`Nothing` keeps the customer on the "
"same screen, with the addition of a confirmation message that the form was "
"submitted successfully. :guilabel:`Redirect` sends the customer to a new "
"webpage, based on the address provided in the :guilabel:`URL` field "
"below. :guilabel:`Show Message` replaces the form with a preconfigured "
"message that informs the customer someone should respond to them as soon as "
"possible."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`On Success`: mijoz formani muvaffaqiyatli yuborganidan so'ng veb-"
"sahifa qanday munosabat bildirishini tanlang. :guilabel:`Nothing` mijozni "
"o'sha ekranda qoldiradi va forma muvaffaqiyatli yuborilgani haqida "
"tasdiqlash xabari qo'shiladi. :guilabel:`Redirect` mijozni "
"quyidagi :guilabel:`URL` maydonida ko'rsatilgan manzil asosida yangi veb-"
"sahifaga yuboradi. :guilabel:`Show Message` formani mijozga tez orada kimdir "
"javob berishi haqida xabar beruvchi oldindan sozlangan xabar bilan "
"almashtiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`URL`: if :guilabel:`Redirect` is selected in the :guilabel:`On "
"Success` field, enter the URL for the webpage, where customers should be "
"directed after successfully submitting a form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`URL`: agar :guilabel:`On Success` maydonida :guilabel:`Redirect` "
"tanlangan bo'lsa, mijozlar formani muvaffaqiyatli yuborganidan so'ng "
"yo'naltirilishi kerak bo'lgan veb-sahifaning URL manzilini kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Visibility`: use the drop-down menu to add any visibility "
"conditions for this field, if desired."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Visibility`: agar xohlasangiz, ushbu maydon uchun ko'rinish "
"shartlarini qo'shish uchun ochiluvchi menyudan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:52
msgid ""
"If *leads* are activated in *CRM* settings, selecting :guilabel:`Create an "
"Opportunity` generates a lead instead. To activate leads, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and tick "
"the :guilabel:`Leads` checkbox. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Agar *CRM* sozlamalarida *lidlar* faollashtirilgan bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Create "
"an Opportunity` tanlanganda imkoniyat o'rniga lid yaratiladi. Lidlarni "
"faollashtirish uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Leads` belgilash katagini belgilang. "
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:57
msgid "Customize contact form fields"
msgstr "Aloqa formasi maydonlarini moslashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:59
msgid ""
"In addition to the settings for the form, the settings for each field can be "
"customized, as well. With the web editor menu still open, click into a field "
"to open the :guilabel:`Field` configuration settings section on the sidebar. "
"The following options are available to customize a field:"
msgstr ""
"Forma sozlamalaridan tashqari, har bir maydonning sozlamalarini ham "
"moslashtirish mumkin. Veb muharrir menyusi ochiq holatida, yon "
"panelda :guilabel:`Field` konfiguratsiya sozlamalari bo'limini ochish uchun "
"maydon ichiga bosing. Maydonni moslashtirish uchun quyidagi variantlar "
"mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: choose a custom field option or an existing field type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Type`: maxsus maydon variantini yoki mavjud maydon turini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Input Type`: determine the type of information customers should "
"input. Available options "
"are :guilabel:`Text`, :guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Telephone`, "
"or :guilabel:`Url`. The selection made in this field limits the format that "
"customers can use when entering information."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Input Type`: mijozlar kiritishi kerak bo'lgan ma'lumot turini "
"aniqlang. Mavjud "
"variantlar: :guilabel:`Text`, :guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Telephone` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Url`. Ushbu maydonda qilingan tanlov mijozlar ma'lumot "
"kiritishda foydalanishi mumkin bo'lgan formatni cheklaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:67
msgid ":guilabel:`Label`: enter the name for the field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Label`: maydon uchun nom kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Position`: choose the way the label is aligned with the rest of "
"the form. The label can be hidden, above the field, to the left of the "
"field, or right adjusted and closer to the field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Position`: yorliqning formaning qolgan qismiga nisbatan "
"joylashish usulini tanlang. Yorliq yashirin bo'lishi, maydon ustida, maydon "
"chap tomonida yoki o'ngga tekislangan va maydonga yaqinroq joylashishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: slide the toggle to add a description for the "
"field, which can provide additional instructions to customers. Click under "
"the field on the form to add the description."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Description`: maydon uchun tavsif qo'shish uchun almashtirgichni "
"suring, bu mijozlarga qo'shimcha ko'rsatmalar berishi mumkin. Tavsifni "
"qo'shish uchun formadagi maydon ostiga bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Placeholder`: enter an example to help users know how to input "
"information where formatting is important, such as a phone number or email "
"address."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Placeholder`: telefon raqami yoki elektron pochta manzili kabi "
"formatlash muhim bo'lgan joylarda foydalanuvchilarga ma'lumotni qanday "
"kiritishni bilishga yordam beradigan misol kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Value`: enter a value to include in the form, by default, "
"if the customer does not provide information in the field. *It is not "
"recommended to include a default value for required fields*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Default Value`: agar mijoz maydonga ma'lumot kiritmasa, formaga "
"standart tarzda kiritiladigan qiymatni kiriting. *Majburiy maydonlar uchun "
"standart qiymat kiritish tavsiya etilmaydi*."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Required`: slide the toggle to mark this field as required if it "
"**must** be filled in for every submission."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Required`: agar bu maydon har bir yuborishda **albatta** "
"to'ldirilishi kerak bo'lsa, uni majburiy deb belgilash uchun almashtirgichni "
"suring."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Visibility`: select when this field should be visible. Use the "
"button on the left to choose whether to show or hide this field on a desktop "
"users. Use the button on the right to choose whether to show or hide this "
"field to mobile users."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Visibility`: bu maydon qachon ko'rinishi kerakligini tanlang. "
"Ushbu maydonni kompyuter foydalanuvchilariga ko'rsatish yoki yashirishni "
"tanlash uchun chap tomondagi tugmadan foydalaning. Ushbu maydonni mobil "
"foydalanuvchilarga ko'rsatish yoki yashirishni tanlash uchun o'ng tomondagi "
"tugmadan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:82
msgid ":guilabel:`Animation`: select if this field should have any animation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Animation`: bu maydonda biror animatsiya bo'lishi kerakligini "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:None
msgid "The field configuration settings on an Odoo website."
msgstr "Odoo veb-saytidagi maydon konfiguratsiyasi sozlamalari."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:89
msgid "View opportunities"
msgstr "Imkoniyatlarni ko'rish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:91
msgid ""
"After a customer submits a contact form, and an opportunity is created, it "
"is assigned based on the :ref:`form settings <crm/customize-contact-form>`. "
"To view opportunities, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Sales --> My "
"Pipeline`."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz aloqa formasini yuborgandan va imkoniyat yaratilgandan so'ng, "
"u :ref:`forma sozlamalari <crm/customize-contact-form>` asosida "
"biriktiriladi. Imkoniyatlarni ko'rish uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Sales --> My Pipeline` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:96
msgid ""
"If leads are activated on the database, contact form submissions are "
"generated as leads, not opportunities. To activate leads, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and tick "
"the :guilabel:`Leads` checkbox. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Agar ma'lumotlar bazasida lidlar faollashtirilgan bo'lsa, aloqa formasi "
"yuborishlari imkoniyatlar emas, lidlar sifatida yaratiladi. Lidlarni "
"faollashtirish uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Leads` belgilash katagini belgilang. "
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:100
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads` to view the newly-created "
"leads."
msgstr ""
"Yangi yaratilgan lidlarni ko'rish uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads` "
"yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:102
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`My Pipeline` dashboard, click on an opportunity card in "
"the Kanban view to open the opportunity record. The information submitted by "
"the customer is visible on the opportunity record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`My Pipeline` boshqaruv panelida, imkoniyat yozuvini ochish uchun "
"kanban ko'rinishidagi imkoniyat kartasiga bosing. Mijoz tomonidan yuborilgan "
"ma'lumotlar imkoniyat yozuvida ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:107
msgid ""
"As the contact form fields are customizable, the fields on the opportunity "
"record, where the form information is stored, varies accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Aloqa formasi maydonlari moslashtiriladigan bo'lgani sababli, forma "
"ma'lumotlari saqlanadigan imkoniyat yozuvidagi maydonlar ham shunga mos "
"ravishda o'zgaradi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:110
msgid ""
"If the preconfigured contact form is used, the *Subject* field is added to "
"the :guilabel:`Title` field, and the content in the :guilabel:`Notes` field, "
"which is labeled as :guilabel:`Your Question`, is added to "
"the :guilabel:`Internal Notes` tab."
msgstr ""
"Agar oldindan sozlangan aloqa formasidan foydalanilsa, *Subject* "
"maydoni :guilabel:`Title` maydoniga qo'shiladi, :guilabel:`Your Question` "
"deb nomlangan :guilabel:`Notes` maydonidagi mazmun esa :guilabel:`Internal "
"Notes` varag'iga qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:115
msgid ":doc:`../pipeline/manage_sales_teams`"
msgstr ":doc:`../pipeline/manage_sales_teams`"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:116
msgid ":doc:`convert`"
msgstr ":doc:`convert`"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:117
#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:130
msgid ":doc:`../track_leads/lead_scoring`"
msgstr ":doc:`../track_leads/lead_scoring`"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:118
msgid ":ref:`Website forms <website/building_blocks/form>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Veb-sayt formalari <website/building_blocks/form>`"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:3
msgid "Create and send quotations"
msgstr "Takliflarni yaratish va yuborish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:5
msgid ""
"Once a qualified lead has been converted into an opportunity, the next step "
"is to create and deliver a quotation. This process can be easily handled "
"through Odoo's *CRM* application."
msgstr ""
"Malakali lid imkoniyatga aylantirilgandan so'ng, keyingi qadam taklif "
"(quotation) yaratish va yetkazishdir. Bu jarayonni Odoo'ning *CRM* ilovasi "
"orqali osongina amalga oshirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:9
msgid "Create a new quotation"
msgstr "Yangi taklif yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:11
msgid ""
"To create a new quotation, open the :menuselection:`CRM app`, revealing "
"the :guilabel:`Pipeline` page on the main *CRM* dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Yangi taklif yaratish uchun :menuselection:`CRM app` ilovasini oching, "
"shunda asosiy *CRM* boshqaruv panelida :guilabel:`Pipeline` sahifasi "
"ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:14
msgid ""
"From here, click on any opportunity to open it. Review the existing "
"information and update any fields, if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Bu yerdan istalgan imkoniyatni ochish uchun unga bosing. Mavjud "
"ma'lumotlarni ko'rib chiqing va zarur bo'lsa, maydonlarni yangilang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:18
msgid ""
"If a quotation has already been created for this opportunity, it can be "
"found by clicking on the :guilabel:`Quotations` smart button at the top of "
"the top of the form. The number of existing quotations is listed on the "
"smart button, as well."
msgstr ""
"Agar ushbu imkoniyat uchun taklif allaqachon yaratilgan bo'lsa, uni forma "
"yuqorisidagi :guilabel:`Quotations` aqlli tugmasini bosish orqali topish "
"mumkin. Mavjud takliflar soni ham aqlli tugmada ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:22
msgid ""
"At the top-left of the form, click the :guilabel:`New Quotation` button."
msgstr ""
"Formaning yuqori chap qismida :guilabel:`New Quotation` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:None
msgid "Qualified lead form with New Quotation button emphasized."
msgstr "New Quotation tugmasi ta'kidlangan malakali lid formasi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:29
msgid ""
"The **Sales** application **must** be installed for the :guilabel:`New "
"Quotation` button to appear."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`New Quotation` tugmasi paydo bo'lishi uchun **Sales** ilovasi "
"**albatta** o'rnatilgan bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:33
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Customer` field is **not** required on the opportunity form."
msgstr "Imkoniyat formasida :guilabel:`Customer` maydoni majburiy **emas**."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:35
msgid ""
"However, customer information must be added or linked before a quotation can "
"be sent. If the :guilabel:`Customer` field is left blank on the opportunity, "
"clicking the :guilabel:`New Quotation` button opens a pop-up window with the "
"following options:"
msgstr ""
"Biroq, taklif yuborilishidan oldin mijoz ma'lumotlari qo'shilishi yoki "
"bog'lanishi kerak. Agar imkoniyatda :guilabel:`Customer` maydoni bo'sh "
"qoldirilgan bo'lsa, :guilabel:`New Quotation` tugmasini bosish quyidagi "
"variantlarga ega qalqib chiquvchi oynani ochadi:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create a new customer`: creates a new customer record, using any "
"available information provided on the opportunity form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Create a new customer`: imkoniyat formasida taqdim etilgan mavjud "
"ma'lumotlardan foydalanib, yangi mijoz yozuvini yaratadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Link to an existing customer`: opens a drop-down field with "
"existing customer names. Select a name to link this new quotation to an "
"existing customer record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Link to an existing customer`: mavjud mijoz nomlari bilan "
"ochiluvchi maydonni ochadi. Ushbu yangi taklifni mavjud mijoz yozuviga "
"bog'lash uchun nomni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Do not link to a customer`: the quotation will **not** be linked "
"to a customer, and no changes are made to the customer information."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Do not link to a customer`: taklif mijozga **bog'lanmaydi** va "
"mijoz ma'lumotlariga hech qanday o'zgartirish kiritilmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:46
msgid ""
"Once this button is clicked, a new quotation form appears. Confirm the "
"information in the top half of the form, and update any missing or incorrect "
"fields:"
msgstr ""
"Ushbu tugma bosilgandan so'ng, yangi taklif formasi paydo bo'ladi. Formaning "
"yuqori yarmidagi ma'lumotlarni tasdiqlang va yetishmayotgan yoki noto'g'ri "
"maydonlarni yangilang:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: the company or contact for whom this quotation was "
"created."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Customer`: ushbu taklif yaratilgan kompaniya yoki kontakt."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Referrer`: if this customer was referred by another customer or "
"contact, select it from the drop-down menu in this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Referrer`: agar ushbu mijoz boshqa mijoz yoki kontakt tomonidan "
"tavsiya qilingan bo'lsa, uni ushbu maydondagi ochiluvchi menyudan tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invoice Address`: physical address where the invoice should be "
"sent."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Invoice Address`: hisob-faktura yuborilishi kerak bo'lgan "
"jismoniy manzil."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:53
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Address`: physical address where any products should be "
"delivered."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Address`: mahsulotlar yetkazib berilishi kerak bo'lgan "
"jismoniy manzil."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quotation Template`: if applicable, select a pre-"
"configured :doc:`quotation template <../../sales/sales_quotations/"
"quote_template>` from this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Quotation Template`: agar mavjud bo'lsa, ushbu maydondan oldindan "
"sozlangan :doc:`taklif shablonini <../../sales/sales_quotations/"
"quote_template>` tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:56
msgid ":guilabel:`Expiration`: date when this quotation is no longer valid."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Expiration`: ushbu taklif amal qilishni to'xtatadigan sana."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quotation Date`: creation date of draft/sent orders, confirmation "
"date of confirmed orders. Note that this field is only visible "
"if :doc:`Developer mode (debug mode) </applications/general/developer_mode>` "
"is active."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Quotation Date`: qoralama/yuborilgan buyurtmalarning yaratilish "
"sanasi, tasdiqlangan buyurtmalarning tasdiqlanish sanasi. E'tibor bering, bu "
"maydon faqat :doc:`Dasturchi rejimi (debug rejimi) </applications/general/"
"developer_mode>` faol bo'lganda ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recurring Plan`: if this quotation is for a recurring product or "
"subscription, select the recurring plan configuration to be used."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Recurring Plan`: agar ushbu taklif takrorlanuvchi mahsulot yoki "
"obuna uchun bo'lsa, foydalaniladigan takrorlanuvchi reja konfiguratsiyasini "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:62
msgid ":guilabel:`Pricelist`: select a pricelist to be applied to this order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pricelist`: ushbu buyurtmaga qo'llaniladigan narxlar ro'yxatini "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Terms`: select any applicable payment terms for this "
"quotation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Payment Terms`: ushbu taklif uchun tegishli to'lov shartlarini "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:70
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Expiration` field automatically populates based on the "
"creation date of the quotation, and the default validity time frame."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Expiration` maydoni taklifning yaratilish sanasi va standart amal "
"qilish muddati asosida avtomatik to'ldiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:73
msgid ""
"To update the default validity time frame, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales "
"app --> Configuration --> Settings --> Quotations & Orders` and update "
"the :guilabel:`Default Quotation Validity` field. To disable automatic "
"expiration, enter `0` in this field."
msgstr ""
"Standart amal qilish muddatini yangilash uchun :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings --> Quotations & Orders` yo'lidan o'ting "
"va :guilabel:`Default Quotation Validity` maydonini yangilang. Avtomatik "
"amal qilish muddati tugashini o'chirish uchun ushbu maydonga `0` kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:77
msgid "When the desired changes are complete, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Kerakli o'zgartirishlar tugallangach, :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:79
msgid ""
"When using a quotation template, the expiration date is based off of "
"the :guilabel:`Quotation Validity` field on the template. To alter the "
"validity date computation on a template, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Configuration --> Sales Orders --> Quotation Templates`."
msgstr ""
"Taklif shablonidan foydalanilganda, amal qilish muddati "
"shablondagi :guilabel:`Quotation Validity` maydoniga asoslanadi. Shablonda "
"amal qilish sanasini hisoblashni o'zgartirish uchun :menuselection:`Sales "
"app --> Configuration --> Sales Orders --> Quotation Templates` yo'lidan "
"o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:83
msgid ""
"Then, click on a template to open it, and update the number in "
"the :guilabel:`Quotation Validity` field."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra shablonni ochish uchun unga bosing va :guilabel:`Quotation Validity` "
"maydonidagi raqamni yangilang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:87
msgid "Order lines"
msgstr "Buyurtma qatorlari"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:89
msgid ""
"After updating the customer, payment, and deadline information on the new "
"quotation, the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab can be updated with the "
"appropriate product information."
msgstr ""
"Yangi taklifda mijoz, to'lov va muddat ma'lumotlarini yangilagandan "
"so'ng, :guilabel:`Order Lines` varag'ini tegishli mahsulot ma'lumotlari "
"bilan yangilash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:92
msgid ""
"To do that, click :guilabel:`Add a product` in the :guilabel:`Order Lines` "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"Buning uchun :guilabel:`Order Lines` varag'ida :guilabel:`Add a product` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:94
msgid ""
"Next, type the name of an item into the :guilabel:`Product` field to search "
"through the product catalog. Then, select a product from the drop-down menu, "
"or create a new one by selecting :guilabel:`Create` or :guilabel:`Create and "
"Edit`."
msgstr ""
"Keyin, mahsulot katalogi bo'ylab qidirish uchun :guilabel:`Product` "
"maydoniga element nomini kiriting. So'ngra ochiluvchi menyudan mahsulotni "
"tanlang yoki :guilabel:`Create` yoki :guilabel:`Create and Edit` ni tanlab "
"yangisini yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:98
msgid ""
"After selecting a product, update the :guilabel:`Quantity`, if necessary. "
"Confirm the information in the remaining fields."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotni tanlagandan so'ng, zarur bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Quantity` ni "
"yangilang. Qolgan maydonlardagi ma'lumotlarni tasdiqlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:101
msgid ""
"To remove a line from the quotation, click the :icon:`fa-trash-"
"o` :guilabel:`(trash can)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Taklifdan qatorni olib tashlash uchun :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(trash "
"can)` belgisini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:103
msgid ""
"To organize products into sections click :guilabel:`Add a section` and type "
"a name for the section. Then, click the :icon:`oi-"
"draggable` :guilabel:`(drag)` icon to the left of the name and drag to move "
"the section to the appropriate location. Move each product using the same "
"method to finish organizing the quotation order lines."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotlarni bo'limlarga ajratish uchun :guilabel:`Add a section` tugmasini "
"bosing va bo'lim uchun nom kiriting. So'ngra, nomning chap "
"tomonidagi :icon:`oi-draggable` :guilabel:`(drag)` belgisini bosing va "
"bo'limni kerakli joyga ko'chirish uchun torting. Taklif buyurtma qatorlarini "
"tartibga solishni yakunlash uchun har bir mahsulotni xuddi shu usul bilan "
"ko'chiring."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:None
msgid ""
"Categories are used to create separate sections on the order lines of a "
"quote."
msgstr ""
"Kategoriyalar taklifning buyurtma qatorlarida alohida bo'limlar yaratish "
"uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:113
msgid "Product catalog"
msgstr "Mahsulot katalogi"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:115
msgid ""
"To quickly add numerous products to the quotation, click "
"the :guilabel:`Catalog` button to open the product catalog."
msgstr ""
"Taklifga ko'plab mahsulotlarni tezda qo'shish uchun mahsulot katalogini "
"ochish maqsadida :guilabel:`Catalog` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:118
msgid ""
"All products in the database are listed as cards and can be sorted in the "
"left panel by :guilabel:`Product Category` and :guilabel:`Attributes`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasidagi barcha mahsulotlar kartalar ko'rinishida ro'yxatga "
"olinadi va chap paneldagi :guilabel:`Product Category` "
"va :guilabel:`Attributes` bo'yicha saralanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:None
msgid "The product catalog displays all products as cards."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot katalogi barcha mahsulotlarni kartalar ko'rinishida ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:125
msgid ""
"To add a product, click the :icon:`fa-shopping-cart` :guilabel:`Add` button "
"on the product card. Set the quantity of the item using the :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`(add)` or :icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`(subtract)` buttons, "
"or type the quantity in the number field between the two buttons. To remove "
"an item, click the :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`Remove` button on the product "
"card."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot qo'shish uchun mahsulot kartasidagi :icon:`fa-shopping-"
"cart` :guilabel:`Add` tugmasini bosing. Mahsulot miqdorini :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`(add)` yoki :icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`(subtract)` "
"tugmalari yordamida belgilang, yoki ikkala tugma orasidagi raqam maydoniga "
"miqdorni kiriting. Mahsulotni olib tashlash uchun mahsulot "
"kartasidagi :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`Remove` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:None
msgid ""
"The purple add and subtract buttons are used to set the quantity of an item."
msgstr ""
"Binafsha rangli qo'shish va ayirish tugmalari mahsulot miqdorini belgilash "
"uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:134
msgid ""
"Once all product quantities are set, click the :guilabel:`Back to Quotation` "
"button to return to the quotation. The items selected in the product catalog "
"now appear in the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab."
msgstr ""
"Barcha mahsulot miqdorlari belgilangandan so'ng, taklifga qaytish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Back to Quotation` tugmasini bosing. Mahsulot katalogida "
"tanlangan mahsulotlar endi :guilabel:`Order Lines` varag'ida ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:138
msgid "Preview and send quotation"
msgstr "Taklifni oldindan ko'rish va yuborish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:140
msgid ""
"To see a preview of the quotation as the customer will see it, click "
"the :guilabel:`Preview` button. Doing so opens a preview in "
"the :guilabel:`Customer Portal`."
msgstr ""
"Taklifni mijoz ko'radigan ko'rinishda oldindan ko'rish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Preview` tugmasini bosing. Shunda :guilabel:`Customer "
"Portal` ichida oldindan ko'rish ochiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:143
msgid ""
"After reviewing the customer preview, click :guilabel:`Return to edit mode` "
"to return to the quotation form in the backend."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz uchun oldindan ko'rishni ko'rib chiqqach, backenddagi taklif formasiga "
"qaytish uchun :guilabel:`Return to edit mode` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:146
msgid ""
"When the quotation is ready to deliver to the customer, click "
"the :guilabel:`Send by Email` button."
msgstr ""
"Taklif mijozga yuborishga tayyor bo'lganda, :guilabel:`Send by Email` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:148
msgid ""
"Doing so opens a pop-up window with a pre-configured email message. "
"Information from the quotation, including the contact information, total "
"cost, and quotation title are be imported from the quotation."
msgstr ""
"Shunda oldindan sozlangan elektron pochta xabari bilan qalqib chiquvchi oyna "
"ochiladi. Taklifdagi ma'lumotlar, jumladan aloqa ma'lumotlari, umumiy narx "
"va taklif sarlavhasi taklifdan import qilinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:152
msgid "A PDF of the quotation is added as an attachment to the email."
msgstr ""
"Taklifning PDF nusxasi elektron pochtaga biriktirma sifatida qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:155
msgid ""
"A pre-loaded template is used to create the email message. To alter the "
"template, click the internal link to the right of the :guilabel:`Load "
"template` field, located at the bottom of the email pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Elektron pochta xabarini yaratish uchun oldindan yuklangan shablon "
"ishlatiladi. Shablonni o'zgartirish uchun elektron pochta qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynasining pastki qismida joylashgan :guilabel:`Load template` maydonining "
"o'ng tomonidagi ichki havolani bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:159
msgid ""
"To select a new template, select an option from the :guilabel:`Load "
"template` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Yangi shablon tanlash uchun :guilabel:`Load template` ochiluvchi menyusidan "
"variantni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:161
msgid ""
"Proceed to make any necessary changes to the email, then "
"click :guilabel:`Send`. A copy of the message is added to the *Chatter* of "
"the of the record."
msgstr ""
"Elektron pochtaga kerakli o'zgartirishlarni kiriting, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Send` tugmasini bosing. Xabarning nusxasi yozuvning "
"*Chatter* qismiga qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:164
msgid ""
"After a quotation is sent, the originating "
"opportunity's :guilabel:`Quotations` smart button updates with a new count. "
"This quotation, and all other quotations can be accessed through this smart "
"button at the top of the opportunity in the *CRM* app."
msgstr ""
"Taklif yuborilgandan so'ng, unga asos bo'lgan "
"imkoniyatning :guilabel:`Quotations` smart tugmasi yangi son bilan "
"yangilanadi. Bu taklif va boshqa barcha takliflarga *CRM* ilovasidagi "
"imkoniyatning yuqori qismidagi ushbu smart tugma orqali kirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:168
msgid ""
"Any quotations attached to the opportunity that are confirmed, and have "
"therefore been converted to sales orders, will be deducted from the number "
"listed on the :guilabel:`Quotations` smart button. Instead, the value of the "
"sales order will appear in the :guilabel:`Orders` smart button located in "
"the same control panel."
msgstr ""
"Imkoniyatga biriktirilgan va tasdiqlanib sotuv buyurtmalariga aylantirilgan "
"har qanday takliflar :guilabel:`Quotations` smart tugmasida ko'rsatilgan "
"sondan ayiriladi. Buning o'rniga, sotuv buyurtmasining qiymati xuddi shu "
"boshqaruv panelida joylashgan :guilabel:`Orders` smart tugmasida paydo "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:174
msgid "Mark an opportunity won or lost"
msgstr "Imkoniyatni yutilgan yoki yo'qotilgan deb belgilash"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:176
msgid ""
"In order to keep the pipeline up to date and accurate, opportunities need to "
"be identified as *won* or *lost* once a customer has responded to a "
"quotation."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline (voronka)ni dolzarb va aniq saqlash uchun mijoz taklifga javob "
"bergandan so'ng imkoniyatlar *yutilgan* yoki *yo'qotilgan* deb belgilanishi "
"kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:179
msgid ""
"To mark an opportunity as *won* or *lost*, return to the opportunity using "
"the breadcrumbs at the top-left of the quotation form. Or navigate "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Sales --> My Pipeline` and click on the "
"correct opportunity to open it."
msgstr ""
"Imkoniyatni *yutilgan* yoki *yo'qotilgan* deb belgilash uchun taklif "
"formasining yuqori chap qismidagi breadcrumb havolalari orqali imkoniyatga "
"qayting. Yoki :menuselection:`CRM app --> Sales --> My Pipeline` yo'lidan "
"o'ting va kerakli imkoniyatni ochish uchun ustiga bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:183
msgid ""
"At the top-left of the form, click on either the :guilabel:`Won` "
"or :guilabel:`Lost` button."
msgstr ""
"Formaning yuqori chap qismida :guilabel:`Won` yoki :guilabel:`Lost` "
"tugmalaridan birini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:185
msgid ""
"If the opportunity is marked *won*, a green :guilabel:`Won` banner is added "
"to the record, and it is moved to the :guilabel:`Won` stage."
msgstr ""
"Agar imkoniyat *yutilgan* deb belgilansa, yozuvga yashil :guilabel:`Won` "
"banneri qo'shiladi va u :guilabel:`Won` bosqichiga ko'chiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:188
msgid ""
"Marking an opportunity as *lost*, via the :guilabel:`Lost` button opens "
"a :guilabel:`Mark Lost` pop-up window, where a :guilabel:`Lost Reason` can "
"be entered."
msgstr ""
"Imkoniyatni :guilabel:`Lost` tugmasi orqali *yo'qotilgan* deb "
"belgilash :guilabel:`Mark Lost` qalqib chiquvchi oynasini ochadi, u "
"yerda :guilabel:`Lost Reason` kiritish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:191
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Lost Reason` drop-down field, choose an existing lost "
"reason. If no applicable reason is available, create a new one by entering "
"it into the :guilabel:`Lost Reason` field, and clicking :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lost Reason` ochiluvchi maydonidan mavjud yo'qotish sababini "
"tanlang. Agar mos sabab mavjud bo'lmasa, uni :guilabel:`Lost Reason` "
"maydoniga kiritib, :guilabel:`Create` tugmasini bosish orqali yangisini "
"yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:196
msgid ""
"It's best practice to try and use pre-configured :guilabel:`Lost Reason` "
"values as much as possible or to limit the creation of new values only to "
"sales team leads. Using consistent values for this parameter will make "
"pipeline analysis easier and more accurate when filtering for "
"the :guilabel:`Lost Reason` parameter."
msgstr ""
"Iloji boricha oldindan sozlangan :guilabel:`Lost Reason` qiymatlaridan "
"foydalanish yoki yangi qiymatlar yaratishni faqat sotuv jamoasi rahbarlariga "
"cheklash eng yaxshi amaliyot hisoblanadi. Ushbu parametr uchun izchil "
"qiymatlardan foydalanish :guilabel:`Lost Reason` parametri bo'yicha "
"filtrlashda pipeline tahlilini osonroq va aniqroq qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:201
msgid ""
"To set up new values for this field, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM --> "
"Configuration --> Lost Reasons`, and click both :guilabel:`New` "
"and :guilabel:`Save` for each new entry added to the list."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu maydon uchun yangi qiymatlarni sozlash uchun :menuselection:`CRM --> "
"Configuration --> Lost Reasons` yo'lidan o'ting va ro'yxatga qo'shilgan har "
"bir yangi yozuv uchun :guilabel:`New` va :guilabel:`Save` tugmalarini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:205
msgid ""
"Additional notes and comments can be added in the :guilabel:`Closing Note` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Qo'shimcha eslatmalar va izohlarni :guilabel:`Closing Note` maydoniga "
"qo'shish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:207
#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:37
#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:179
msgid ""
"When all the desired information has been entered in the :guilabel:`Mark "
"Lost` pop-up window, click :guilabel:`Mark as Lost`."
msgstr ""
"Barcha kerakli ma'lumotlar :guilabel:`Mark Lost` qalqib chiquvchi oynasiga "
"kiritilgandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Mark as Lost` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:210
msgid ""
"Upon clicking :guilabel:`Mark as Lost`, the pop-up window disappears, and "
"Odoo returns to the opportunity form, where a new red :guilabel:`Lost` "
"banner is now present in the upper-right corner of the opportunity."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mark as Lost` tugmasi bosilgach, qalqib chiquvchi oyna yopiladi "
"va Odoo imkoniyat formasiga qaytadi, u yerda imkoniyatning yuqori o'ng "
"burchagida yangi qizil :guilabel:`Lost` banneri paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:214
msgid ""
"Once an opportunity is marked as *lost*, it is no longer considered active, "
"and it is removed from the pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Imkoniyat *yo'qotilgan* deb belgilangach, u endi faol hisoblanmaydi va "
"pipeline (voronka)dan olib tashlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:217
msgid ""
"In order to view a *lost* opportunity from the pipeline, click "
"the :guilabel:`down arrow icon` to the right of the search bar, and select "
"either :guilabel:`Lost` or :guilabel:`Archived` from the drop-down menu that "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline (voronka)dan *yo'qotilgan* imkoniyatni ko'rish uchun qidiruv "
"panelining o'ng tomonidagi :guilabel:`down arrow icon` belgisini bosing va "
"paydo bo'lgan ochiluvchi menyudan :guilabel:`Lost` yoki :guilabel:`Archived` "
"variantlaridan birini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes.rst:222
msgid ""
"While opportunities that have been marked as *lost* are considered "
"*Archived*, be advised that, in order for an opportunity to be included as "
"*lost* in reporting, it **must** be specifically marked as *lost*, not "
"*Archived*."
msgstr ""
"*Yo'qotilgan* deb belgilangan imkoniyatlar *Arxivlangan* hisoblansa-da, "
"e'tibor bering: imkoniyat hisobotlarda *yo'qotilgan* sifatida qo'shilishi "
"uchun u *Arxivlangan* emas, aynan *yo'qotilgan* deb belgilanishi **shart**."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize.rst:5
msgid "Optimize your Day-to-Day work"
msgstr "Kundalik ishingizni optimallashtiring"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:3
msgid "CRM Gamification"
msgstr "CRM Geymifikatsiyasi"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo's *CRM* app, *gamification tools* provide the opportunity to "
"evaluate and motivate users through customizable challenges, goals, and "
"rewards. Goals are created to target actions within the *CRM* app, and can "
"be tracked and rewarded automatically to participating sales teams."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'ning *CRM* ilovasida *geymifikatsiya vositalari* foydalanuvchilarni "
"moslashtiriladigan musobaqalar, maqsadlar va mukofotlar orqali baholash va "
"rag'batlantirish imkonini beradi. Maqsadlar *CRM* ilovasi ichidagi "
"harakatlarga yo'naltirilgan holda yaratiladi hamda ishtirok etayotgan sotuv "
"jamoalari uchun avtomatik ravishda kuzatilishi va mukofotlanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:12
msgid ""
"To install the *CRM Gamification* module, navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Apps` application. Click into the :guilabel:`Search...` "
"bar at the top of the page and remove the :guilabel:`Apps` filter. Type `CRM "
"Gamification` to search."
msgstr ""
"*CRM Gamification* modulini o'rnatish uchun :menuselection:`Apps` ilovasiga "
"o'ting. Sahifaning yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`Search...` paneliga bosing "
"va :guilabel:`Apps` filtrini olib tashlang. Qidirish uchun `CRM "
"Gamification` deb yozing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:16
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`CRM Gamification` module, click :guilabel:`Install`. This "
"module features goals and challenges related to the *CRM* and *Sales* "
"applications."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`CRM Gamification` modulida :guilabel:`Install` tugmasini bosing. "
"Ushbu modul *CRM* va *Sales* ilovalariga oid maqsadlar va musobaqalarni o'z "
"ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:None
msgid "View of the gamification module being installed in Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo'da geymifikatsiya modulining o'rnatilishi ko'rinishi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:24
msgid ""
"If **both** the *CRM* and *Sales* apps are installed, the *CRM Gamification* "
"module is automatically installed on the database."
msgstr ""
"Agar *CRM* va *Sales* ilovalarining **ikkalasi ham** o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, "
"*CRM Gamification* moduli ma'lumotlar bazasiga avtomatik ravishda "
"o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:27
msgid ""
"To access the *Gamification Tools* menu, first enable :ref:`developer-mode`."
msgstr ""
"*Gamification Tools* menyusiga kirish uchun avval :ref:`developer-mode` "
"rejimini yoqing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:29
msgid "Next, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Gamification Tools`."
msgstr ""
"Keyin, :menuselection:`Settings app --> Gamification Tools` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:None
msgid "View if the gamification tools menu in Odoo Settings."
msgstr "Odoo Sozlamalaridagi geymifikatsiya vositalari menyusi ko'rinishi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:38
msgid "Create badges"
msgstr "Nishonlar yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:40
msgid ""
"*Badges* are awarded to users when they have completed a challenge. "
"Different badges can be awarded based on the type of task completed, and can "
"be issued to more than one user, depending on the time they accomplish the "
"goal."
msgstr ""
"*Nishonlar* foydalanuvchilarga musobaqani yakunlaganlarida beriladi. "
"Bajarilgan vazifa turiga qarab turli nishonlar berilishi mumkin va ular "
"maqsadga erishgan vaqtiga qarab bir nechta foydalanuvchiga taqdim etilishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:44
msgid ""
"To view the existing badges, or create a new one, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Settings --> Gamification Tools --> Badges`."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud nishonlarni ko'rish yoki yangisini yaratish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Settings --> Gamification Tools --> Badges` yo'lidan "
"o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:None
msgid "View of the badges page in Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo'dagi nishonlar sahifasi ko'rinishi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:52
msgid ""
"Some badges can be awarded outside of challenges, as well. Select the Kanban "
"card for the desired badge, then click :guilabel:`Grant`. This opens "
"a :guilabel:`Grant Badge` pop-up window. Select a user from "
"the :guilabel:`Who would you like to reward?` field."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi nishonlar musobaqalardan tashqarida ham berilishi mumkin. Kerakli "
"nishonning kanban kartasini tanlang, so'ngra :guilabel:`Grant` tugmasini "
"bosing. Bu :guilabel:`Grant Badge` qalqib chiquvchi oynasini "
"ochadi. :guilabel:`Who would you like to reward?` maydonidan foydalanuvchini "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:56
msgid ""
"Add any additional information regarding why the user is receiving the "
"reward in the field below, then click :guilabel:`Grant Badge`."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi nima uchun mukofot olayotgani haqidagi qo'shimcha "
"ma'lumotlarni quyidagi maydonga kiriting, so'ngra :guilabel:`Grant Badge` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:59
msgid ""
"To create a new badge, click :guilabel:`New` at the top-left of the page to "
"open a blank form. Enter a name for the :guilabel:`Badge`, followed by a "
"description."
msgstr ""
"Yangi nishon yaratish uchun sahifaning yuqori chap qismidagi :guilabel:`New` "
"tugmasini bosib, bo'sh formani oching. :guilabel:`Badge` uchun nom kiriting, "
"so'ngra tavsif yozing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:62
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Allowance to Grant` field determines when a badge can be "
"granted, and by whom:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Allowance to Grant` maydoni nishon qachon va kim tomonidan "
"berilishi mumkinligini belgilaydi:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:64
msgid ":guilabel:`Everyone`: this badge can be manually granted by any user."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Everyone`: bu nishon har qanday foydalanuvchi tomonidan qo'lda "
"berilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`A selected list of users`: this badge can only be granted by a "
"select group of users. If this option is selected, it generates a new "
"field, :guilabel:`Authorized Users`. Choose the appropriate users from this "
"drop-down list."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`A selected list of users`: bu nishon faqat tanlangan "
"foydalanuvchilar guruhi tomonidan berilishi mumkin. Agar ushbu variant "
"tanlansa, yangi :guilabel:`Authorized Users` maydoni paydo bo'ladi. Ushbu "
"ochiluvchi ro'yxatdan mos foydalanuvchilarni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`People having some badges`: this badge can only be granted by "
"users who have already been awarded a specific badge. If this option is "
"selected it generates a new field, :guilabel:`Required Badges`. Use this "
"drop-down list to select the badge(s) a user must have before they can award "
"this badge to others."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`People having some badges`: bu nishon faqat ma'lum bir nishon "
"bilan taqdirlangan foydalanuvchilar tomonidan berilishi mumkin. Agar ushbu "
"variant tanlansa, yangi :guilabel:`Required Badges` maydoni paydo bo'ladi. "
"Foydalanuvchi ushbu nishonni boshqalarga berishidan oldin ega bo'lishi kerak "
"bo'lgan nishon(lar)ni tanlash uchun ushbu ochiluvchi ro'yxatdan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No one, assigned through challenges`: this badge cannot be "
"manually granted, it can only be awarded through challenges."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`No one, assigned through challenges`: bu nishonni qo'lda berib "
"bo'lmaydi, u faqat musobaqalar orqali taqdim etilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:75
msgid ""
"To limit the number of badges a user can send, tick the :guilabel:`Monthly "
"Limited Spending` checkbox. This sets a limit on the number of times a user "
"can grant this badge. In the :guilabel:`Limitation Number` field, enter the "
"maximum number of times this badge can be sent per month, per person."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi yuborishi mumkin bo'lgan nishonlar sonini cheklash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Monthly Limited Spending` belgilash katagini belgilang. Bu "
"foydalanuvchi ushbu nishonni berishi mumkin bo'lgan marotaba soniga cheklov "
"o'rnatadi. :guilabel:`Limitation Number` maydoniga ushbu nishonni oyiga, har "
"bir kishi uchun yuborish mumkin bo'lgan maksimal sonni kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:None
msgid "The details page for a new badge."
msgstr "Yangi nishon uchun tafsilotlar sahifasi."

