msgid ""
"To apply a fiscal position to a POS order in the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/"
"open-register>`, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon, click the :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Tax` button, and "
"choose the desired fiscal position from the list."
msgstr ""
":ref:`POS kassasida <pos/use/open-register>` POS buyurtmasiga fiskal "
"pozitsiyani qo'llash uchun :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) belgisini bosing, :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Tax` tugmasini "
"bosing va ro'yxatdan kerakli fiskal pozitsiyani tanlang."

