"> Security --> More security settings --> Encryption & credentials` yo'lidan "
"o'ting, so'ng :guilabel:`Install a certificate` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/receipt_printers.rst:102
msgid ""
"Once the device is set up, :ref:`install <general/install>` "
"the :guilabel:`POS iMin` module and :ref:`connect the device to your Odoo "
"database<pos/epos-printers/configuration>`, leaving the IP address field "
