"usullari :guilabel:`Payment` tugmasi yonida yorliq tugmalari sifatida "
"ko'rsatiladi. To'lov usulini bosish buyurtmani darhol tasdiqlaydi va sizni "
"chek ekraniga olib boradi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods.rst:102
msgid ""
"While cash payments are supported, the one-click payment feature assumes the "
"amount received is exact. If the customer requires change, use the "
"standard :guilabel:`Payment` button to enter the amount tendered manually."
msgstr ""
"Naqd pul to'lovlari qo'llab-quvvatlansa-da, bir bosishda to'lov funksiyasi "
"qabul qilingan summani aniq deb hisoblaydi. Agar mijozga qaytim kerak "
"bo'lsa, to'langan summani qo'lda kiritish uchun standart :guilabel:`Payment` "
"tugmasidan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods.rst:107
msgid ""
"The feature is unavailable for online, delivery, terminal, or ID-verified "
"payment methods."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu funksiya onlayn, yetkazib berish, terminal yoki shaxsi tasdiqlanadigan "
"to'lov usullari uchun mavjud emas."

