"the top-right. This action displays a diagnostics screen with the IP "
"address, which is required for the :ref:`payment method configuration "
"process <pos/cashdro/odoo_configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"Cashdro apparatining IP manzilini aniqlash uchun apparat ichidagi "
"qurilmalardan birini olib tashlang. Masalan, apparatning chap tomonidagi "
"banknot qurilmasini pastdan ilgagini bo'shatib, tortib chiqaring. Paydo "
"bo'lgan xato ekranida yuqori o'ng burchakdagi :icon:`fa-info` "
"(:guilabel:`info`) belgisini bosing. Bu amal IP manzil ko'rsatilgan "
"diagnostika ekranini ochadi, bu manzil :ref:`to'lov usulini sozlash jarayoni "
"<pos/cashdro/odoo_configuration>` uchun talab qilinadi."

