msgid ""
"QFPay payment terminals do not require an :doc:`IoT Box </applications/"
"general/iot>` to operate."
msgstr ""
"QFPay to'lov terminallari ishlashi uchun :doc:`IoT Box </applications/"
"general/iot>` talab qilinmaydi."

