msgstr ""
"HaoJin App orqali :guilabel:`POS-KEY` yarating: :menuselection:`Haojin App --"
"> My --> Settings --> Pos Call Up Key --> Reset Key` yo'lidan o'ting. "
"So'ngra yaratilgan :guilabel:`POS-KEY` kalitini nusxalang."

