msgid ""
"The **Asynchronous Notifications** are automated messages confirming "
"successful payments or refunds by QFPay."
msgstr ""
"**Asynchronous Notifications** — bu QFPay tomonidan muvaffaqiyatli to'lovlar "
"yoki qaytarimlarni tasdiqlovchi avtomatik xabarlardir."

