msgstr ""
"Agar terminalning IP manzili o'zgarsa, uni :ref:`Odoo POS sozlamalarida <pos/"
"use/settings>` yangilang va QFPay-dan yangi o'z-o'zidan imzolangan "
"sertifikat so'rang."

