"POS mahsulot kategoriyalari POS kassasida mahsulotlarni guruhlash va "
"navigatsiyani osonlashtirish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:257
msgid "To manage POS categories, follow these steps:"
