"savatda tanlang, :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`Actions`) belgisini, "
"so'ngra :icon:`fa-arrow-down` :guilabel:`Transfer course` tugmasini bosing "
"va kerakli bosqichni tanlang."

