msgid "Reject order pop-up"
msgstr "Buyurtmani rad etish qalqib chiquvchi oynasi"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant/urban_piper.rst:330
msgid ""
"**Swiggy** orders cannot be directly rejected. Attempting to reject one "
"prompts Swiggy customer support to contact the restaurant. Similarly, "
"**Deliveroo**, **JustEat**, and **HungerStation** do not allow order "
"rejection. Always follow the respective provider's guidelines for handling "
"such cases."
msgstr ""
"**Swiggy** buyurtmalarini to'g'ridan-to'g'ri rad etib bo'lmaydi. Rad etishga "
"urinish Swiggy mijozlarni qo'llab-quvvatlash xizmatining restoran bilan "
"bog'lanishiga olib keladi. Xuddi shunday, **Deliveroo**, **JustEat** va "
"**HungerStation** ham buyurtmani rad etishga ruxsat bermaydi. Bunday "
"holatlarni hal qilishda doimo tegishli provayderning ko'rsatmalariga amal "
"qiling."

