msgid "Select a sales order or quotation"
msgstr "Sotuv buyurtmasi yoki taklifni tanlash"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:18
msgid ""
"From the POS register, click the :icon:`oi-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon and :icon:`fa-link` :guilabel:`Quotation/Order` to open the "
"list of quotations and sales orders created from the sales application. When "
"loaded, the sales order reference number is displayed under the ordered "
"products, next to the :icon:`fa-shopping-basket` (:guilabel:`shopping "
"basket`) icon."
msgstr ""
"POS kassasidan :icon:`oi-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) "
"piktogrammasini va :icon:`fa-link` :guilabel:`Quotation/Order` ni bosib, "
"sotuv ilovasida yaratilgan takliflar va sotuv buyurtmalari ro'yxatini "
"oching. Yuklangandan so'ng, sotuv buyurtmasining ma'lumotnoma raqami "
"buyurtma qilingan mahsulotlar ostida, :icon:`fa-shopping-basket` "
"(:guilabel:`shopping basket`) piktogrammasi yonida ko'rsatiladi."

