msgstr ""
"Miqdorni o'zgartirish uchun :guilabel:`Qty` tugmasini bosing, so'ngra raqam "
"paneli yordamida mahsulotlar sonini kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:118
msgid ""
"To add a discount, click :guilabel:`%`, then enter the discount value using "
"the numpad."
msgstr ""
"Chegirma qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`%` tugmasini bosing, so'ngra raqam paneli "
"yordamida chegirma qiymatini kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:119
msgid ""
"To modify the product price, click :guilabel:`Price`, then enter the new "
"amount using the numpad."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot narxini o'zgartirish uchun :guilabel:`Price` tugmasini bosing, "
"so'ngra raqam paneli yordamida yangi summani kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:121
msgid ""
"Optionally, add a :ref:`customer <pos/use/customers>` or a :ref:`note <pos/"
"use/notes>` to the order."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy ravishda buyurtmaga :ref:`mijoz <pos/use/customers>` "
"yoki :ref:`izoh <pos/use/notes>` qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:123
msgid ""
"Once the order is complete, click :guilabel:`Payment` to proceed to the "
"payment screen."
msgstr ""
"Buyurtma tayyor bo'lgach, to'lov ekraniga o'tish uchun :guilabel:`Payment` "
