msgstr ":guilabel:`Customer` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:148
msgid "Enter the customer's details, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz ma'lumotlarini kiriting, so'ngra :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

