msgstr ""
"O'sha sahifada davom etib, **Personal information** bo'limida ro'yxatdan "
"o'tishni yakunlash uchun quyidagi ma'lumotlarni to'ldiring:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:44
msgid ""
"Enter your phone number, email, and address. Complete any verification steps "
"(e.g., :abbr:`OTP (One-Time Password)` via SMS)."
msgstr ""
"Telefon raqamingiz, elektron pochtangiz va manzilingizni kiriting. Barcha "
