"Products --> Products` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Create` tugmasi orqali "
"mahsulot yarating. Mahsulot shablonida parametrlarni quyidagicha sozlang:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:91
